# Linear & PR Completion Rules

When you complete a task assigned from Linear:
1. Provide a comprehensive summary of changes made.
2. Always put `Fixes <ISSUE-ID>` in the PR title or body (example: `Fixes HOS-7`). The GitHub Action `linear-preview-comment.yml` uses that id to post the Vercel Preview URL onto the Linear issue.
3. If you are communicating back to Linear or commenting on the issue, write a clear, concise comment in Hebrew detailing:
   - מה שונה ואיזה קבצים עודכנו.
   - איך הבעיה נפתרה.
   - קישור ל-PR שנפתח.
   - קישור Preview של Vercel לבדיקה במובייל (אם כבר קיים).
4. Ensure the PR description also includes `Fixes <ISSUE-ID>` and the bullet-point breakdown of changes.
